	"data": "Module 3: Embedding Engine — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nThe embedding engine turns M2's chunked documents into vectors. It's the pipeline's brain — the only module that talks to the GPU. It takes Chunk objects from the ingest engine, embeds them via Ollama's qwen3-embedding:4b model, caches vectors in SQLite to avoid redundant work, and passes (vector, chunk, metadata) tuples downstream to M4 (Qdrant…",
